category: Libs
requires: cygwin libssl3
sdesc: "RFC5297-compliant C implementation of AES-SIV (runtime)"
ldesc: "This is an RFC5297-compliant C implementation of AES-SIV written by Daniel
Franke on behalf of Akamai Technologies. It is published under the Apache
License (v2.0). It uses OpenSSL for the underlying AES and CMAC
implementations and follows a similar interface style."
external-source: libaes_siv

